Fixes:
- Particle size and blur were fixed pixels, so the field looked coarse in small frames and fine at 4K; they are now set for a frame 1920 wide and scale with it.

diff --git a/src/video/elements/remotion-ui/particle-field.tsx b/src/video/elements/remotion-ui/particle-field.tsx
